	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Sero mihi domum reverso libellus ille tuus<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Gemeint ist <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> neueste Publikation "Der christliche Ehestand"; vgl. oben <ref target="file11409">Nr. 1366</ref>, 2-6 mit Anm.1.</note> <persName ref="p4321">uxorculę meę</persName><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="2"><persName ref="p4321">Katharina, geb. Ryff</persName>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>missus exhibetur, pariter autem indicatur summo diluculo <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>abiturum nuncium<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Unbekannt.</note>, quo minus quicquam ego nunc pro amicicia nostra, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>quam<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>vor</hi> quam <hi>gestrichenes, unleserliches Wort.</hi></note> renovas subinde, scribere possum.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Maximas tamen <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>et uxoris et meis verbis gratias tibi ago, quod nostri etiamnum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>tam amanter memineris et, quam constans sis in retinendo <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>pristino amore, non obscuris argumentis testeris.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Nobis <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>hoc quidem tempore nihil est, unde tantę tuę benevolentię <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>beneficentięque vicissim<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b">vicissim <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> respondere et paria tecum facere possimus, nisi <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quod sancte affirmamus animum nostrum tam esse tui <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>studiosum et amantem quam vix cuiusquam et fore speramus, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ut re ipsa declarare hunc ex animi sententia liceat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Ego 4. februarii huc redii<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> hatte sich nach seinem Weggang aus <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName> am 6. Dezember, wo er seit dem 27. Juni 1539 gewirkt hatte, noch in <placeName ref="l907">Kempten</placeName>, <placeName ref="l320">Memmingen</placeName> und <placeName ref="l234">Isny</placeName> aufgehalten; s. <hi>Roth</hi> II 441-449 und 469f, Anm. 98; Theodor <hi>Pressel,</hi> Ambrosius Blaurer's des schwäbischen Reformators Leben und Schriften, Stuttgart 1861, S. 444-451.</note> satis bonis, quod aiunt, avibus<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><bibl source="b56">Adagia</bibl>, 1, 1, 75 (<bibl source="b370">LB</bibl> II 57).</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>nisi quod unam istam ominosam <persName ref="p7852">episcopum</persName> <placeName ref="l2283">Londensem</placeName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p7852">Johann von Weeze</persName>, Erzbischof von <placeName ref="l2283">Lund</placeName> und Bischof von <placeName ref="l257">Konstanz</placeName>.</note> obviam <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>habuimus, cum ipsi quoque <placeName ref="l2528">lacum</placeName> traiiceremus illo <placeName ref="l977">Arbam</placeName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><placeName ref="l977">Arbon</placeName> (Arbor felix, Arbona, <placeName ref="l774">Kt. Thurgau</placeName>).</note> navigante.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Verum nihil nobis hinc periculi impendebat, partim, quod <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>non procul abessemus a portu, partim, quod nostra navis optim<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>e esset instructa, maxime vero, quia de domini protectione <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>certissimi eramus.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Unum illud valde nobis dolet, quod <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>tam late serpit hic cancer<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>2Tim 2, 17</ref></cit>.</note> et pomeria sua magno <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>patrię nostrę malo, sic enim valde timemus, profert.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Tu cum tota, quę isthic est, ecclesia dominum precamini, ut praesentissimo <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>nobis consilio et auxilio propicius adsit, ne quid cum nobis <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>nostroque<pb type="edition" next="65"/> nomine tum vero maxime se indignum admittamus, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>neve, qui multis iam annis a se pendentes servati sumus, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>nobis permissi semel perdamur.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Graviter a satana tentamur, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>quem servator Christus sub pedes nostros conterat<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Röm 16, 20</ref></cit>.</note>, id quod tum <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>fiet, ubi veram ac solidam resipiscentiam et<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>vor</hi> et <hi>gestrichenes, unleserliches Wort.</hi></note> primam <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>rursus charitatem amplexi fuerimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale, mi <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>observande pariter et charissime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, et pro tuo candore <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>indiligentius scribenti ignosce; nam supra modum iam distineor.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Sic vero habe me inter tui studiosos et amantes studiosissimum <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>et amantissimum esse.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Optimis et clarissimis viris <persName ref="p8127">Pellicano</persName>, <persName ref="p1753">Leoni</persName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><persName ref="p1753">Leo Jud</persName>.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z34"/><persName ref="p8171">Theodoro</persName><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note>, <persName ref="p8412">Megandro</persName> cęterisque administris tuis postquam salutem <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>dixeris meis verbis, quam potes officiose me commenda; <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>saluta vero praecipue sanctissimam tuam <persName ref="p8051">coniugem</persName><note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="12"><persName ref="p8051">Anna, geb. Adlischwyler</persName>.</note>, quam una <persName ref="p4321">tecum <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>mea</persName><note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="13"><persName ref="p8055">Blarers</persName> Ehefrau <persName ref="p4321">Katharina, geb. Ryff</persName>.</note> quoque cum <persName ref="p8178">fratre</persName><note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14"><persName ref="p8178">Thomas Blarer</persName>.</note> et <persName ref="p4334">sorore</persName><note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15"><persName ref="p4334">Margaretha Blarer</persName>.</note> multum in Christo salvere iub<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>ent seque vobis christianice commend[ant]<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d">Textverlust wegen Beschädigung des Papierrandes.</note>. 10. martii anno 1540.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Tuus <persName ref="p8055">A. Blaur</persName><note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e"><hi>Datum und Unterschrift am Rande.</hi></note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Praestantissimo viro domino <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>fratri suo charissimo [ac?]<note xml:id="fnf" type="footnote" n="f"><hi>Adresse teilweise auf das nicht mehr vorhandene Verschlußband geschrieben.</hi></note> <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>inter primos praecipuo.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
